{"title":"The Palantir mafia and microschools","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-palantir-mafia-and-microschools","date":1755529232000,"content":"<h2>These ‘Child Online Safety’ Laws Do Not Protect Kids and Are A Gift To Big Tech</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zQhV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89912d23-1160-408f-863b-2b811d56dc50_3600x2401.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zQhV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89912d23-1160-408f-863b-2b811d56dc50_3600x2401.jpeg\" width=\"434\" height=\"289.4326923076923\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zQhV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89912d23-1160-408f-863b-2b811d56dc50_3600x2401.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zQhV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89912d23-1160-408f-863b-2b811d56dc50_3600x2401.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zQhV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89912d23-1160-408f-863b-2b811d56dc50_3600x2401.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zQhV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89912d23-1160-408f-863b-2b811d56dc50_3600x2401.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Marsha Blackburn is the co-sponsor of the Kids Online Safety Act, a dangerous censorship bill.</figcaption></figure></div><p>As age verification laws sweep the US and the prospect of a federal \"online safety\" law similar to the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2025/jul/24/what-are-the-new-uk-online-safety-rules-and-how-will-they-be-enforced\">UK's gains momentum</a>, boosters of these policies claim that they're necessary to rein in \"Big Tech.\" In reality, the laws expand surveillance, threaten startups and independent communities, and further consolidate Big Tech's power.</p><p>All of this is part of the bipartisan effort to silence speech and crack down on dissent by dismantling free expression and civil liberties online. I <a href=\"https://zeteo.com/p/the-latest-government-gift-to-big\">wrote about how Big Tech is benefitting</a> from these “child safety” laws this weekend <a href=\"https://zeteo.com/p/the-latest-government-gift-to-big\">in Zeteo</a>. </p><h2>Meet the Palantir Mafia Taking Over Tech</h2>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-palantir-mafia-and-microschools\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"e08266bcbec7cea12de12b515884c2fb8fac017ebe88b21b38c48d0e1482e5cf","category":"Sites"}